<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/23/msa@/~cl_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "9" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/23/msa@> .
